=========================================================
	Comments
=========================================================
Atk contains tags. For example force, mechanic (like shild break), e.t.c
Only player has states => two sources of state changes: 1. Input, 2. Atk/Parry effect

Atk/parry process:
Phys collision, check if happened. Add parry/atk intention

---------------------------------------------------------
	Types
---------------------------------------------------------
Enemy atk:
1. hit determiner
2. hit executer. Could change player state
Player atk:
1. hit determiner
2. hit executer
3. parry executer. Could change player state

